THIRD-PARTY LICENSES
====================

This file is generated by cargo-about from about.toml and about.hbs; do not
edit it by hand. Regenerate it with scripts/third-party-licenses (CI fails
when it is stale).

It has two parts. The first holds the notices of code ported into unityrs
from other projects; the notice of a new port is added to about.hbs. The
second holds the licence of every crate the unityrs workspace builds, its own
members included, grouped by licence text. A crate offered under a choice of
licences (such as "MIT OR Apache-2.0") is listed under the one about.toml
prefers. liblzma-sys is also listed under 0BSD, the licence of the xz sources
it vendors and compiles.

